            "reviews": "“Might just make you a little more hopeful for the future. With its contemporary and thought-provoking themes, accessibility through its diverse and rich characters, and beautiful story about what it means to be human, 2064 is an uplifting experience that I'll remember for years to come.”<br>9/10 – RPG Site<br><br>“The mystery-suspense developments involving organized conspiracies grips the player’s heart and mind and doesn’t let go.”<br>32/40 – Famitsu<br><br>“ROM is a resounding success and one of the most affecting adventures I've ever had.”<br>8/10 – GameSpot<br>",
